; Expected diagnostics, in order:
;   1. :bpm — input encounter walks declared keys; bpm's value is the
;      wrong underlying type.
;   2. :wat — extra keyword surfaces during the same pass.
;   3. :title — missing required key emitted at the post-pass step;
;      the key name is part of the message, not the path.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code wrong_underlying :path [scene bpm])
  (diagnostic :code unknown_key :path [scene wat])
  (diagnostic :code missing_required_key :path [scene]))
